		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} put on the Snooze Ribbon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0752_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can only get one ribbon per week...\rIf you want another ribbon, come find\nme again next week!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0752_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sunny: AYO, you found ALL my siblings!\rWe homies now, right? I think so!\rHere’s a Smile Ribbon! I almost forgot!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0752_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sunny: That Smile Ribbon looks great\non your Pokémon...</language>
